| !Fractals: freeglut's affine fractals demo (Koch snowflake, from the file fractals/dat).
| Cursor keys move, Page Up/Down zoom, + and - change the detail.
| Built unchanged from freeglut 3.8.0 (progs/demos) against riscos-mesa's
| freeglut, whose RISC OS back end uses Wimp windows, Wimp menus and native
| EGL. Text output goes to the file Output in this application.
Set Fractals$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set Fractals$Output /|<Fractals$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !Fractals needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !Fractals needs ARMEABISupport
Do Run <Fractals$Dir>.!RunImage /<Fractals$Dir>/fractals.dat
